{
  "key": "chain/gated-room",
  "kind": "chain",
  "summary": "Gated reverb: a big bright room cut off short, the 80s snare (Phil Collins, synthwave)",
  "tags": [
    "gated reverb",
    "gated",
    "80s",
    "snare",
    "big drums",
    "synthwave",
    "retro"
  ],
  "devices": [
    "DattorroReverb",
    "Gate"
  ],
  "links": [
    "production/synthwave"
  ],
  "checked": {
    "how": "written",
    "by": "claude (chains from the bench's gaps)",
    "date": "2026-11-12",
    "opendaw": "652e6ca"
  },
  "body": [
    "A dense room at high level, then a gate that closes 150 ms after each hit. On the drum track (TakeDo has no separate snare bus).",
    "amount sets the room level. If the hats pump the gate open, raise the threshold."
  ],
  "apply": {
    "params": {
      "track": {
        "type": "track",
        "about": "the part to put it on, or master"
      },
      "amount": {
        "type": "amount"
      }
    },
    "steps": [
      {
        "op": "add_effect",
        "input": {
          "track": "$track",
          "effect": "DattorroReverb",
          "settings": [
            {
              "param": "preDelay",
              "value": 5
            },
            {
              "param": "decay",
              "value": 0.85
            },
            {
              "param": "damping",
              "value": 0.1
            },
            {
              "param": "wet",
              "value": {
                "dial": [
                  -10,
                  -3
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "param": "dry",
              "value": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "op": "add_effect",
        "input": {
          "track": "$track",
          "effect": "Gate",
          "settings": [
            {
              "param": "threshold",
              "value": -28
            },
            {
              "param": "attack",
              "value": 0.5
            },
            {
              "param": "hold",
              "value": 150
            },
            {
              "param": "release",
              "value": 40
            },
            {
              "param": "floor",
              "value": -72
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
